nding instrument so  thank you  it sounds good it's a nice sound but  when I let go of the bases  foreign  it sounds like it's Amplified or it's  resonating in a church or something  let's listen to a piece played on the  instrument this is a beautiful violin  piece actually by composer named Bieber  not the Bieber you're thinking a baroque  composer who wrote this on violin  apostolia that works very well on orange  loot  [Music]  foreign  foreign  [Music]  thank you  [Music]  foreign  foreign  about getting this instrument from  Madrid but before sharing that story I  just wanted to mention if you're  enjoying my YouTube videos and want to  help support the Channel please do  subscribe I am at the moment 5 000  subscribers away from reaching 400  000 subscribers at which point I'm going  to do a fun twin Reveal video and  introduce all of you to my identical  twin brother who is a singer so please  do subscribe now back to the story I  actually heard of the luthier Jose  Miguel Mourinho from other luteinists  who play as instruments and I was pretty  interested and so while I was in Spain I  decided to pop over to Madrid and meet  him in person play a bunch of his  instruments and I was just so amazed by  the volume of the instruments and then  that natural  that sympathetic resonation I've never  heard an instrument do that before  um to that extent so I decided I wanted  one but I I couldn't buy the instrument  then I couldn't bring it home with me so  normally I would just you know buy a  seat for it and or maybe hope it hope to  fit in the overhead and bring it home  this time I couldn't I had to wait and I  had to ship it but with such a nice  instrument  um it was scary but I went with DHL I  ended up costing a lot more than I  thought it ended up costing me almost  twelve hundred dollars with custom fees  to chip this instrument here so that was  a bummer  um but it made it safely it made it one  piece everything's fine it plays just  like it did when I pla